pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=149029196472\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker25","name":"Shigov Monster","legend":"Journeying folk say a relic monster of 9 ft long inhabits Shigov Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker26","name":"Korsk Vampire","legend":"Whispers speak of a huge Vampire who inhabits Korsk hills and attacks unsuspecting victims."},{"id":"marker27","name":"Trubc Ogre","legend":"Tales speak of a fat Ogre who inhabits Trubc hills and snatches people from homes."},{"id":"marker28","name":"Vyshek Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Slovan Spirits."},{"id":"marker29","name":"Gozyrnipo Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Slovan Spirits."},{"id":"marker30","name":"Vologache Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Slovan Spirits."},{"id":"marker31","name":"Horod Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Slovan Spirits."},{"id":"marker32","name":"Luteshkin Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Slovan Spirits."},{"id":"marker33","name":"Vyslavl Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Slovan Spirits."},{"id":"marker34","name":"Tarden Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ዐሰጠሀ  ለፀጠወነዐጰሰፈለጸሠአጰከዐፐአገፀጸተቀረረጸፀሰገፐለበ ጰሐ የዘደፈ ቀሰፈተነየፐ </div>"},{"id":"marker35","name":"Lererevgo Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ከ መየ ፀተአጸሠ ወጸበ ገለጠደቀደጠዐሠቀሐሀረ ነጠከፀፀ ለዐቀወሠዘረፈጠየሠዐዘበፐወገነሐገ</div>"},{"id":"marker36","name":"Mitford Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༁ༀ༗༨༺༐༿༅༘༮༿༒༇༼༳༲༆༻༨༇༜༴༆༠༦༌༇༕༉༨༖༨༠༣༼༒༔༼༿༙༪༨༺༸༜༻༡༳༤༙༉༣༿༙༯༼༅༰༔༰༶༹༒༇༜༸༅༧༮༶༳༰༷༜༸༩༩༰༧༭༓༢༓༱༗</div>"},{"id":"marker37","name":"Rzhev Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡙᠿᠠᠨᡰᠡ᠑ᠪᠯᢑᡜᢦᢠᠦᢤᡏᡏᡒᢠᢁᡱᠿᠧ᠀ᡯᢐᡕᡱᠧᠾᠨᢂᠳᡒᡕᢢᢥᡑᠵᠿᡍᠿ᠑ᡟᡜᡯᡑ᠒ᢤᡞᡲᡎᢤᡱᠵᢁᡏᠽ</div>"},{"id":"marker38","name":"Belzhetsla Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⳃ ⳔⳠⳀⳒⳜⳚⳁⳠⳔ⳥ⲾⳭⲴⳬ  ⳆⳄ⳥⳩ⳞⳁⳜⳎⳈⳭⳔⳊⳞⲼⲸⳜⳌⳫⳈⲶⳜⳀⳎⳚⳬ Ⳁ ⳬⳐⳞⲴⳌⳜⳜⳠⳂ⳹ⲶⲴ⳧ⳄⳎ⳹ⲶⳭⳢⲶⳐ </div>"},{"id":"marker39","name":"Sikinomih Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc1d\udc05\udc26\ud802𐠛\ud802 \udc2f 𐠦\ud802\ud802𐠠\ud802𐠌𐠷\udc24\ud802\ud802𐠩\udc1a𐠚\udc35𐠪\udc0c\udc20\udc2d𐠖\udc2a𐠮𐠵\udc32\udc33𐠛\udc28\ud802𐠰𐠡\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker40","name":"Ovech Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> \ud802𐠪\udc2b𐠡\udc1c𐠌\ud802𐠒𐠅𐠝\ud802\ud802𐠱 \udc22\ud802𐠘\ud802𐠥𐠐\ud802𐠔𐠄\udc02\ud802𐠍\udc2d𐠈𐠟\udc18\udc3c\ud802𐠞\udc38𐠏\udc26\udc2a\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠏\ud802 \udc30\ud802\ud802𐠢\ud802\ud802𐠌𐠣\udc0f \udc27𐠯\udc1c\udc21\udc34\udc1d\udc21 \udc02\udc3c\ud802\ud802 \udc10\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker41","name":"Ksniatin Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⳏ⳥ ⳁⲺ⳹ⳎⳢⳬⳊⲾⳎⳃ ⳢⳭⲸⳠ⳧Ⲽ Ⳳ⳧ⲼⳖⳔⲲ ⲺⳬⳎⳔ⳩ⳘⳫⲼ⳪Ⳁⳁ⳥⳾ⲾⲶⳭⳃⳞ ⳹Ⳣ ⳘⲼⳈⲾ⳾ Ⲹⳁ⳥ⳜⳫ⳾Ⳕ⳧Ⳋ ⳜⲴ</div>"},{"id":"marker42","name":"Zvemyansk Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">⳹  ⳭⳤⳁⳫⲾⳠⳁⳠⳊⳤⳎⳠⳠⳒ ⳾ⳐⳌⳚⲼ⳩ ⳹ⲼⳞⳠⲲ⳪ⳢⲾⳤⳎⳈ⳾ⳌⳲⳊⳔⳎⲾⳐ⳩ⲼⳤⳄ ⳲⲺⳎⳌ⳧ⳢⲲⳬⳘⳃⳬⳔ⳾ⳘⲴⳔⲴⳬⲴ</div>"},{"id":"marker43","name":"Ruined Fortress","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker44","name":"Ruined Stronghold","legend":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker45","name":"Ruined Town","legend":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker46","name":"Ruined Fortress","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker47","name":"Ruined Fortification","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortification. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker48","name":"Ruined City","legend":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker49","name":"Ruined Fortress","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker50","name":"Ruined Mausoleum","legend":"Ruins of an ancient mausoleum. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker51","name":"Ruined Stronghold","legend":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker52","name":"Minor Jetty","legend":"A small location along the Pevitsk River to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"id":"marker53","name":"Minor Jetty","legend":"A small location along the Prorysk River to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"id":"marker54","name":"Ravens migration","legend":"A huge group of ravens are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker55","name":"Camels migration","legend":"A huge group of camels are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker56","name":"Ravens migration","legend":"A huge group of ravens are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker57","name":"Hares migration","legend":"A huge group of hares are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker58","name":"Tigers migration","legend":"A huge group of tigers are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker59","name":"Kopos Pit","legend":"The Kopos Pit. Locals claim that it is totally empty."},{"id":"marker60","name":"Semoshesk Necropolis","legend":"A foreboding necropolis shrouded in perpetual darkness, where eerie whispers echo through the winding corridors and spectral guardians stand watch over the tombs of long-forgotten souls."},{"id":"marker61","name":"Redckingham Cemetery","legend":"A sprawling necropolis built within a labyrinthine network of catacombs. Its halls are lined with countless alcoves, each housing the remains of the departed, while the distant sound of rattling bones fills the air."},{"id":"marker62","name":"Wiverming Necropolis","legend":"This ethereal necropolis seems suspended between the realms of the living and the dead. Wisps of mist dance around the tombstones, while haunting melodies linger in the air, commemorating the departed."},{"id":"marker63","name":"Harlisted Tomb","legend":"A towering necropolis adorned with macabre sculptures and guarded by formidable undead sentinels. Its ancient halls house the remains of fallen heroes, entombed alongside their cherished relics."},{"id":"marker64","name":"Zhica Graveyard","legend":"This cursed necropolis is veiled in perpetual twilight, perpetuating a sense of impending doom. Dark enchantments shroud the tombs, and the moans of anguished souls resound through its crumbling halls."},{"id":"marker65","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/6251\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker66","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/11241\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker67","n